  * the NVIDIA 580 user space for Maxwell, Pascal and Volta (ORDER 354): 37 packages of source nvidia-graphics-drivers, nvidia-settings (libxnvctrl0, libxnvctrl-dev), nvidia-modprobe, nvidia-persistenced, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-fabricmanager, libnvidia-nscq, cuda-drivers, cuda-drivers-580 and nvidia-legacy-580xx-kernel-dkms. Only Debian's and deb-multimedia's builds are blocked; NVIDIA's own repository is not named by any record, so its compute packages stay NVIDIA's (sparky-stereo-cuda-repo's pin)
